{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です(｡・・｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はある番組のロケをしてました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がんばったよおおお"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっとグローバル化したい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/28/2568835/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/28/2568835/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ナチュラル外はね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/28/2568835/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう10月もおわってしまう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はやいよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年も残り2ヶ月。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっという間だったなー。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか、さみしくなる(´；ω；｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時が経つのがはやすぎて\n寂しくなる(´；ω；｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか、すごいよね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時って！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんで時間があるのか\n月日が経つのか\n歳をとるのか\n考え出すと不思議なことがいっぱい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"当たり前にあることが、\n当たり前じゃなくなる時がこわい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人類にとって大きいこと！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"例えば、時間とか季節とか\n次元とか時空とか！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"空気がなくなったり\n時間が巻き戻っていったり\n信号がなくなるだけで\n大変なことになる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こわいねー、考えれば考えるほど！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/28/2568835/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしたは、代々木第一体育館で\n日テレハロウィンライブがあるよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がんばります！みててね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明後日は握手会！\nまだ咳とか声とか治ってないけど\nがんばるから楽しみましょう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは、きょうはこのへんで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい！"}],"source":"archive"}